OL,3,GNEWSASchool's plan to use toilet
OL,4,Achaperones puts pupils at risk, says
OL,5,Acampaigner
OL,6,
OL,7,FA school where some secondary-age
OL,8,Fpupils are escorted to the toilet could
OL,9,Fbe discouraging them from seeking help
OL,10,Ffor periods and other health issues, a
OL,11,Fcampaigner has warned.
OL,13,FMolly Fenton, founder of the Love Your
OL,14,FPeriod campaign, said she would have
OL,15,Fbeen unlikely to use school toilets if
OL,16,Fshe had needed to be accompanied as a
OL,17,Fpupil, and said it put students "at
OL,18,Frisk".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
