OL,3,GNEWSASchool's plan to use toilet
OL,4,Achaperones puts pupils at risk, says
OL,5,Acampaigner
OL,6,
OL,7,FEbbw Fawr Learning Community in Blaenau
OL,8,FGwent introduced the chaperones in
OL,9,Fresponse to costly vandalism and
OL,10,Fexcessive time spent out of lessons.
OL,12,FCouncils set a school's toilet
OL,13,Fpolicies, the Welsh government said,
OL,14,Fadding they must be "accessible to all
OL,15,Flearners throughout the school day,
OL,16,Ftaking into account pupils' basic
OL,17,Fneeds".
